<title>USA: Kentek sees Q1 below analysts' forecasts.</title>
<headline>Kentek sees Q1 below analysts' forecasts.</headline>
<dateline>BOULDER, Colo. 1996-09-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kentek Information Systems Inc said on Thursday it expected earnings for the first quarter ending September 30 to fall &quot;substantially below&quot; analysts' forecasts.</p>
<p>The company also sees first-quarter revenue 15 percent to 20 percent less than forecast. It said reduced sales of printers and accessories would hurt its results.</p>
<p>Analysts have forecast $17.88 million in revenue and earnings of $0.20 a share, according to the consensus estimate.</p>
</text>
